## Overview

The file is a minimal Express app with two GET endpoints (`/health`, `/users`) and a hardcoded user list. It's small, but small apps still have meaningful gaps — and more importantly, it lacks the security baseline you'd want before adding any real functionality. Below I work through OWASP Top 10–relevant findings.

