The app sends no `Content-Security-Policy`, `X-Content-Type-Options`, `Strict-Transport-Security`, `X-Frame-Options`, etc. Express also sends an `X-Powered-By: Express` header by default, which is fingerprintable.

**Recommendation** — use [`helmet`](https://helmetjs.github.io/) and disable the powered-by header:

```js
