### 9. ⚠️ No Graceful Shutdown / Health vs. Readiness Distinction (OWASP A04)
**Severity:** Informational

`/health` returns `ok` unconditionally — it can't actually detect downstream failures. For real deployments, separate liveness (`/healthz`) from readiness (`/readyz`, which checks DB/cache/etc.) so load balancers can route correctly. Avoid leaking infra details (versions, hostnames) in either.

